<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys up on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Hayleys up on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayleys Ltd rose 2.15 percent or four rupees to 190 on Wednesday on turnover of 5,500 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Sellers are calling the shots and dictating the price,&quot; said a trader with a foreign joint venture stock broking firm.</p>
<p>Hayleys Ltd is one of three blue chip conglomerates listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
